 "9_0": "Compressor design with 3-level noise reduction：",
 "9_1": "<f1>Noise Reduction Structure Design</f1><f2>-Compressor</f2>",
 "9_3": "<f1>The compressor installation adopts soft connection, d</f1><f2>esign a thickened base with 3 bolts to secure the compressor and </f2><f3>Vibration soft contact, reduce vibration transmission</f3>",
 "9_5": "<f1>Design a high-density </f1><f2>insulation sealing cover (with sound-dampening cotton)</f2><f3>wrapped around the compressor to isolate sound propagation</f3>",
 "9_7": "It’s wrapped with PVC damping and soundproofing cotton, effectively reducing the noise and vibration generated during compressor operation",
 "10_0": "<f1>Noise Reduction Structure Design</f1><f2>-Sheet metal cotton</f2>",
 "10_1": "Design the sheet metal and side panels around the compressor and paste PU sound-absorbing cotton for multi-stage soundproofing and noise reduction.",
 "10_2": "Sound-absorbing cotton",
 "11_0": "Chassis & Antifreezing",
 "11_1": "High strength thickened chassis, designed with reinforced ribs penetrating the installation base, overall reinforcement to avoid high and low frequency resonance noise.",
 "11_3": "<f1>The chassis comes standard with </f1><f2>chassis electric heating</f2><f3> to prevent condensation water from freezing in winter, ensuring reliable operation of the unit.</f3>",
 "12_0": "Easy Installation",
 "12_1": "Water pressure gauge",
 "12_3": "Design electrical wiring holes close to the lower part of the unit, in line with market demand, and separate strong and weak electricity to ensure safe and reliable wiring",
 "12_5": "Red is the water outlet pipe",
 "12_6": "Blue is the water inlet pipe",
 "12_7": "Design a location that meets market demand and quickly connect water pipes",
 "12_8": "High pressure gauge for refrigerant",
 "12_9": "Ambient Temperature Sensor",
 "12_10": "Unit structure upgrade, 1. Move the inlet and outlet pipes and wire holes to the middle and lower part of the back of the unit, which is more in line with the usage habits of European installation personnel, making it convenient to connect and wire;",
 "12_11": "2. Equipped with standard water pressure gauge and refrigerant high-pressure gauge, it facilitates customers to intuitively understand the operating pressure of the unit and analyze fault problems.",
 "13_0": "R290 Refrigerant Leakage Protection",
 "13_1": "<f1>The unit is equipped with a </f1><f2>2-level refrigerant leakage protection design</f2><f3>, which prevents refrigerant leakage from entering the room and ensures safe operation of the unit.</f3>",
 "13_3": "<f1>① </f1><f2>Standard refrigerant leakage sensor</f2><f3>, when the </f3><f4>leakage concentration exceeds 15% LFL</f4><f5>, the system will sound an alarm and di</f5><f6>splay fault code, r</f6><f7>eminding users to handle it in a timely manner to ensure saf</f7><f8>e use. The compressor and all electric heating will stop, and the fan is running at the lowest speed.</f8>",
 "13_5": "<f1>② Standard </f1><f2>microbubble exhaust valve, </f2><f3>when the refrigerant inside the plate heat exchanger leaks and mixes into the water pipe, the exhaust valve can promptly release the refrigerant, preventing it from entering the room and ensuring system safety.</f3>",
